# Service account keys and PEMs. The Firebase admin credential is the one that
# matters here: it can mint tokens for any user in the project, so it lives in
# apps/api-ts/.env locally and in GitHub Secrets for deploys — never in git.
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
*serviceAccount*.json
*service-account*.json
credentials.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
